  "description": "Structured concurrency for C# and .NET. Run tasks in parallel in a TaskGroup: the first failure cancels the rest, no task outlives the group, and you get the real error instead of a TaskCanceledException. Includes C# equivalents of JavaScript's Promise.all, Promise.any and Promise.allSettled (TaskGroup.AllAsync, AnyAsync and AllSettledAsync), a concurrency limit, and Go's select for System.Threading.Channels.",
